        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northleoda">Norðleod.</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Mæsseþegnes 7 worldþegnes II þusend þrimsa.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">That of a mass-thegn ["a priest in full orders"] and a secular thegn 2,000 thrymsas.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Mæsseþegenes 7 woruldþegenes II þusend þrymsa.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">A mass-priest and a secular thegn, two thousand thrymsas.</ab>
